{
  "id": "c10",
  "title": {
    "zh-CN": "收尾"
  },
  "start": "c10_n0001",
  "nodes": {
    "c10_n0001": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "暑假过到尾巴上，天还热，人却懒了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0002"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0002": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡和特蕾西黏在一起的时间越来越多，多到朋友都看不下去。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0003"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0003": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "这天傍晚，几个人在艾玛的花店门口支了张折叠桌吃西瓜。威廉刚把一个瓜拍开，抬头就看见那两个人走过来——特蕾西的手搭在卢卡的小臂上，卢卡空着的那只手，还拎着她的护目镜，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0004"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0004": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "也不知道是什么时候帮她摘下来的，就提在手里晃。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0005"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0005": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "来了来了，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0006"
      },
      "speaker": "william"
    },
    "c10_n0006": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "威廉拿西瓜皮敲桌子，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0007"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0007": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "模范情侣又来了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0008"
      },
      "speaker": "william"
    },
    "c10_n0008": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西耳尖一红，把手抽回来，又觉得抽回来更显得心虚，僵在原地。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0009"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0009": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你俩能不能收敛点。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0010"
      },
      "speaker": "emma"
    },
    "c10_n0010": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "艾玛翻了个白眼，递过去两瓣西瓜，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0011"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0011": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "上回我去工坊找你，推门看见你俩……算了，我不说了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0012"
      },
      "speaker": "emma"
    },
    "c10_n0012": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我们什么都没干。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0013"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c10_n0013": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西瞪她。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0014"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0014": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "是是是，你们什么都没干，就抱在一起看图纸。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0015"
      },
      "speaker": "emma"
    },
    "c10_n0015": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "艾玛说。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0016"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0016": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "海伦娜坐在一旁，安静地笑，眼睛没往谁那儿看，只慢悠悠地开口："
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0017"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0017": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡，你手里那副护目镜，可以还给人家了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0018"
      },
      "speaker": "helena"
    },
    "c10_n0018": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡这才低头，看见自己还拎着特蕾西的护目镜，愣了一下，递回去。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0019"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0019": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "谢了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0020"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c10_n0020": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西接过去戴上，把脸遮了小半。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0021"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0021": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你看你看，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0022"
      },
      "speaker": "william"
    },
    "c10_n0022": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "威廉起哄，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0023"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0023": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "还脸红。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0024"
      },
      "speaker": "william"
    },
    "c10_n0024": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我没有。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0025"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c10_n0025": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西说。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0026"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0026": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "艾米丽给每个人分纸巾："
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0027"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0027": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "行了，让他俩吃瓜，别老欺负人。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0028"
      },
      "speaker": "emily"
    },
    "c10_n0028": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "奈布从头到尾没说话，等大家闹完，才从冰桶里拎出两瓶可乐，一瓶放卢卡面前，一瓶放特蕾西面前，瓶身上还凝着水珠。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0029"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0029": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "谢了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0030"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c10_n0030": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡说。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0031"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0031": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "奈布"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0032"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0032": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "嗯"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0033"
      },
      "speaker": "naib"
    },
    "c10_n0033": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "了一声，又坐回去。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0034"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0034": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "西瓜吃完，天擦黑，人陆续散了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0035"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0035": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "艾玛走的时候拉着特蕾西说了几句悄悄话，说得特蕾西直点头，末了艾玛拍拍她："
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0036"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0036": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "有事喊我，我罩你。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0037"
      },
      "speaker": "emma"
    },
    "c10_n0037": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "知道了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0038"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c10_n0038": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西说。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0039"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0039": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "海伦娜路过卢卡身边，脚步顿了顿："
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0040"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0040": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她今天心情好，你别惹她。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0041"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c10_n0041": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "没等卢卡回答，就走了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0042"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0042": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "威廉最后一个走，走前还冲他俩挤眉弄眼："
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0043"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0043": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "明天还来啊，我买了个新的拍子——不对，你们玩你们的。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0044"
      },
      "speaker": "william"
    },
    "c10_n0044": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "说完自己笑成一团，被艾米丽拎着后领拽走了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0045"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0045": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡和特蕾西站在花店门口，看着他们走远。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0046"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0046": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "走吧。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0047"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c10_n0047": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西说。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0048"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0048": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "两人并肩往家走。路灯一盏盏亮起来。特蕾西的手很自然地伸过来，卢卡也很自然地握住，十指扣上。谁也没说话，谁也没觉得需要说话。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0049"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0049": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "跟暑假第一天过马路时、手心全是汗的那次不一样了。现在牵手，平常得跟呼吸一样。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0050"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0050": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0051"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c10_n0051": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西忽然说。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0052"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0052": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "嗯。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0053"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c10_n0053": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "大学，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0054"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c10_n0054": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她顿了顿，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0055"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0055": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你报哪儿。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0056"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c10_n0056": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "跟你一起。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0057"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c10_n0057": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0058"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0058": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你报哪儿，我报哪儿。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0059"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c10_n0059": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你专业怎么办。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0060"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c10_n0060": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0061"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0061": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你那个物理，要好的学校。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0062"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c10_n0062": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "能跟你一个城市就行。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0063"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c10_n0063": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0064"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0064": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我想跟你待着。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0065"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c10_n0065": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西别过脸，没说话，只把他的手握得更紧了些。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0066"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0066": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "过了好一会儿，她才开口："
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0067"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0067": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "那，一起。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0068"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c10_n0068": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "快到特蕾西家门口的时候，她忽然停住。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0069"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0069": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "去工坊待会儿吧。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0070"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c10_n0070": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0071"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0071": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我想听音乐盒。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0072"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c10_n0072": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "两人拐进工坊。特蕾西开了灯，走到工作台前，从架子上拿下那个黄铜的音乐盒——擦得干干净净，一点灰都没有。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0073"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0073": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她上了发条，音乐慢慢流出来。是那段很慢的调子。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0074"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0074": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "两人并排坐在那张旧沙发上。特蕾西把头靠在他肩上。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0075"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0075": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "暑假快过完了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0076"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c10_n0076": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她说。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0077"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0077": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "嗯。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0078"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c10_n0078": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "这两个月，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0079"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c10_n0079": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她顿了顿，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0080"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0080": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "跟做梦一样。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0081"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c10_n0081": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "不是梦。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0082"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c10_n0082": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0083"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0083": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "是真的。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0084"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c10_n0084": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我知道。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0085"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c10_n0085": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西说，又往他肩上靠了靠，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0086"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0086": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "就是，太开心了，有点不真实。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0087"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c10_n0087": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她伸手，戳了戳音乐盒上那个外露的齿轮，看着它一下一下地转。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0088"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0088": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "以后，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0089"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c10_n0089": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0090"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0090": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我们还有好多好多这样的暑假。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0091"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c10_n0091": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡低头，亲了亲她的发顶。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0092"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0092": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "嗯。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0093"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c10_n0093": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0094"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0094": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "慢慢来。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0095"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c10_n0095": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "音乐盒转着，转到第三分钟，发条走完，声音渐渐弱下去，最后停住。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0096"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0096": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西坐起来，重新上满发条。音乐又响起来。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_n0097"
      }
    },
    "c10_n0097": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "窗外，天已经黑透了，工坊的灯亮着，暖黄的一片。两个人靠在一起，谁也没再说要回家。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c10",
        "nodeId": "c10_ending"
      }
    },
    "c10_ending": {
      "kind": "ending",
      "ending": "summer_together"
    }
  }
}
